8eb42479fa1b4c387b7250891a1a0e2e561af172f3a9de506","download_count":186,"created_at":"2026-10-02T02:26:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T02:26:50Z"},{"id":604612091,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84kCaX7","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:12e2e5e1a53d5b368862340581aabae832c01885d33d74dd737b78eac9748594","download_count":544,"created_at":"2026-10-02T02:18:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T02:18:38Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 聊天新增持久化的每轮用量卡片，显示 Token、缓存命中、费用与输出速度。\n- 修复编程 Agent 用量归属、单次费用与累计统计，保留中断任务用量并更新延迟返回的统计。\n- 群聊回复气泡新增每轮用量卡片，加载历史消息时可恢复显示。\n- 自定义模型定价支持选择已配置的供应商和模型，保留手动输入 ID 并改善加载失败提示。\n- 修复 Codex 上下文超限后的会话恢复，下一条消息使用新上下文继续，并保留 Studio 历史与工作区。\n- 修复 Grok 使用 DeepSeek Chat Completions 时的消息角色兼容问题。\n- 修复同一连接切换 Profile 后会话历史空白的问题。\n- 统一 Studio 抽屉尺寸和工作区选择器布局，修复群聊 Agent 设置抽屉的遮挡与加载问题，并避免回车误提交会话重命名。\n\n## What's Changed\n* [codex] show persisted usage and token speed for completed runs by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3241\n* [codex] fix Grok requests to DeepSeek Chat Completions by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3244\n* Fix agent usage attribution, interrupted cards and cumulative totals by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3246\n* fix(coding-agent): recover normal turns after context overflow by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3204\n* fix(chat-run): allow reading a session owned by another profile on the same socket by @lioraluo920-dev in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3242\n* Add group chat Token cards inside reply bubbles by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3248\n* [codex] fix Studio drawers and workspace picker UI by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3247\n* feat(usage): select configured providers and models for pricing by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3253\n* chore: release Studio 0.7.27 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3255\n\n## New Contributors\n* @lioraluo920-dev made their first contribution in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3242\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.26...v0.7.27","mentions_count":3}
